# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# www to the bare domain, permanently. One canonical address is worth real
# money to a local business: every link, citation and review profile that
# points at either spelling consolidates onto the same URL in Google's index
# instead of splitting the site's authority across two hosts.
#
# :splat carries the rest of the path through, so a deep link like
# www.glensmokeshop.com/cigars.html lands on cigars.html and not the home page.
https://www.glensmokeshop.com/*  https://glensmokeshop.com/:splat  301!
